+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, typing
+    :tickets: 9669
+
+    Fixed typing issue where :meth:`_orm.PropComparator.and_` expressions would
+    not be correctly typed inside of loader options such as
+    :func:`_orm.selectinload`.
